    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102530" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταυρ-εία</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορά</span>), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bull's hide, ox-hide</i>, hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>a kind of drum covered with skin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				14.25.3
			</span></i> (unless in sense <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>whip of ox-hide</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάραγνα</span>
			.</div>
